  "instructions": [
    "Combine pinto beans, pickle juice, granulated sugar, dark soy sauce, rice vinegar, sesame oil, salt, and black pepper in a large bowl.",
    "Mix well to combine.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a molcajete or a heatproof bowl.",
    "Add water and make sure the pinto beans are covered.",
    "Cover the bowl with a lid or plastic wrap and steam for 20 minutes over boiling water.",
    "Check if the pinto beans are tender by inserting a fork or knife.",
    "If not tender, steam for an additional 5 minutes.",
